!CHECK 233676.00 | 233667.04 80 233677.74 02 | line 10 C FETCH BB,XTENTB+.4,$+1.32
!CHECK 233677.00 | 231164.22 00 | line 11 Z,YMPSAV (byte prints "C0", open round; see header)
!CHECK 233677.40 | 000020.00 80 234363.26 A0 | line 12 TI,11,$0,C LR (byte prints "AC"; see header)
!CHECK 233700.40 | 233701.25 80 234165.34 06 | line 13 C SCNOP BBZ,$+0.53,C NDX F
